!
! This test calculates the CC energy with the X2C Hamiltonian
!
**DIRAC
.TITLE
X2C Hamiltonian, with large speed of light (NR limit). CCSD energies.
.WAVE F
**GENERAL
.CVALUE
1.0d8
**INTEGRALS
.NUCMOD
 1
*READIN
.UNCONTR
**HAMILTONIAN
.X2C
**WAVE FUNCTIONS
.SCF
.EXACC
*SCF
.EVCCNV
1.0E-9 1.0E-7
.MAXITR
30
**EXACC
.OCCUPIED
energy -10000.0 0.0 0.001
.VIRTUAL
energy -1.0 100. 0.001
.CCiT
.AUTOKERNEL
.AUTOSCHEME
1
.EXATENSOR
.PRINT
2
#.TALSH_BUFF
#65
**MOLECULE
*COORDINATES
.UNITS
AU
*SYMMETRY
.NOSYM
*BASIS
.DEFAULT
cc-pVDZ
*END OF
